L1: Temperate performance and metabolic adaptations following endurance training performed under environmental heat stress
L2: Physiological Reports (2021)
L3: Ed Maunder, Daniel J. Plews, Gareth A. Wallis, Matthew J. Brick, Warren B. Leigh, Wee‐Leong Chang, Casey M. Watkins, Andrew E. Kilding
